e learning methods that help us organizing them. In natural language understanding, we look deeper into text and study the content on the word, phrase, sentence or paragraph level. However, it will also be possible to follow this lecture without having attended IRTM. Prior knowledge in programming is, however, required.</p> </body>\",\n            ects: 6,\n            term: \"WS, jährlich\",\n            recTerm: \"4\",\n            duration: \"1\",\n            chair: \"Lehrstuhl für Grundlagen der Sprachverarbeitung\",\n            offerBegin: \"Sommersemester 2024\",\n            offerEnd: \"(leer)\",\n            workload: [\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"Präsenzzeit\",\n                hours: 42\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"\",\n                hours: NaN\n              },\n              {\n                type: \"Selbststudium\",\n    